321
00:38:50,557 --> 00:38:51,641
Necesitaba esto.

322
00:38:52,726 --> 00:38:54,186
Vamos a trabajar juntos.

323
00:38:58,648 --> 00:38:59,483
Sí.

324
00:39:01,485 --> 00:39:02,360
