330
00:39:21,046 --> 00:39:22,005
Entiendo.

331
00:39:23,048 --> 00:39:24,049
Si mi...

332
00:39:26,510 --> 00:39:27,427
Si mi...

333
00:39:30,305 --> 00:39:33,809
